ind":"announcement","title":"New Weapons! Ship & Combat Upgrades","summary":"New Weapons Arrive! Major Upgrades to Ship Destruction and Combat!Ahoy, captains! We've got some new toys for you to play with! 🏴‍☠️This update introduces a new ship armor system, improves combat physics, and equips two ships with brand-new weapons. Here's what's new:💥 Ship Destruction OverhaulNew Armor System: Destructible structures no longer break on the first hit. Their armor gradually wears down, and the structure only breaks apart once all its armor is depleted.Improved ship physics feedba","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-22T06:02:35Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114031350","verified_at":"2026-10-22T06:46:33Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4981100-1846018067943236","game_id":"steam-4981100","kind":"update","title":"A Small Update Is Live!","summary":"We’ve rolled out a small update for Broadside Bash to make it easier to jump in and smoother to play.The new tutorial covers the game’s rules and controls, so new players can get up to speed before heading into a match. We’ve also adjusted the respawn rules and fixed some in-game stuttering.We’ve polished a few map details and adjusted some UI elements, too. And now, after you’re eliminated, the camera focuses on your killer—so next time someone catches you with a sneaky shot, you’ll know who di","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-13T07:44:35Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067943236","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:55:07Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4981100-1844751498220578","game_id":"steam-4981100","kind":"announcement","title":"Fix the issue where the Esc key causes the ship design interface to freeze","summary":"Thank you very much for your feedback. We have addressed the issue where pressing Esc while using the ship design interface caused the screen to freeze abnormally. We warmly welcome all test users to continue reporting any game issues to us.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-24T08:03:08Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498220578","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:55:07Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4981100-1844115010504103","game_id":"steam-4981100","kind":"update","title":"Major Content Update for Broadside Bash Demo!!!","summary":"Major Content Update for Broadside Bash Demo!!!The gameplay flow has been fully upgraded!!!Did you feel that the previous gameplay flow was too short? We’ve reworked and improved the gameplay flow!Now, you will build your team’s warship from scratch!Before each match begins, you and your teammates will spawn together at your island dockyard.There are plenty of resources on the island, and you can collect them to build your own ships!We’ve added a more advanced ship system, including basic, inter","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-22T12:53:11Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010504103","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:55:07Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4981100-1842212951312248","game_id":"steam-4981100","kind":"update","title":"Multiplayer Synchronization Hotfix","summary":"This update focuses on fixing ship controls, cannon fire, projectile visibility, and environmental destruction synchronization in multiplayer matches.Fixed an issue that prevented non-host players from controlling ships.Fixed delayed, reverted, or invalid destruction effects caused by cannon fire from non-host players.Fixed cases where destruction was visible but the corresponding cannonball was missing.Standardized network identifiers for cannons, ship wheels, and other interactive stations to ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-01T05:56:19Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951312248","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:55:07Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4981100-1841579228673286","game_id":"steam-4981100","kind":"update","title":"Patch Notes - August 23, 2026","summary":"We have fixed an issue where player skins would not display correctly in certain situations, and optimized the delay during cannonball destruction effects.We will continue working on fixing bugs and improving the game. If you encounter any issues, please feel free to report them in the community.Thank you for your support and encouragement!If you are interested in Broadside Bash, please consider adding it to your wishlist. It means a lot to us!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-23T11:38:49Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228673286","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:55:07Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4981100":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:54:37Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T05:54:36Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4981100":"2026-10-26T05:54:37Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4981100":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:54:36Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T05:54:36Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"4981270":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:54:37Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T05:54:37Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4981100","app_id":4981100,"app_scope":"base","obser